      "entityUrn": "urn:li:fsd_update:(urn:li:activity:7457085421605539840,MAIN_FEED,DEBUG_REASON,DEFAULT,false)",
      "commentary": "Hi, network! I once again find myself in an unfortunate position due to a recent round of layoffs. I am #opentowork and starting my search for my next role.\n\nWith about 8 years of experience, I\u2019ve spent the last 5 months at WeatherBug leading user acquisition and revenue growth via paid media, subscription and app store optimization initiatives. My focus was on scaling efficiently and improving attribution. \n\nI\u2019m looking for a (preferably remote) role in growth or performance marketing, ideally in the app space. If you know of anything or can make an intro, it would mean a lot.\n\nI will also be attending MAU Vegas this month\u2014would love to connect in person if you\u2019ll be there!",
      "actorName": "Tori Mondi",
